/* Embeds the compiled DXGI proxy shader DLL (built from shader/proxy.c) into
   the unlocker executable as an RCDATA resource. The unlocker writes this out
   to the Ferns client folder when "install shader" is pressed.

   dxgi.dll must exist in this directory at build time — build it first from
   shader/proxy.c (see build.bat / README). */
SHADER_DLL RCDATA "dxgi.dll"
